<title>USA: Wichita PBC, Kan., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Wichita PBC, Kan., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Inc. said it won $17 million</p>
<p>of Wichita Public Building Commission, Kan., revenue bonds Series I</p>
<p>1996 (U.S.D. No. 259 Telecommunications and Data Processing System Project), with a true interest cost of 5.008 percent.</p>
